<title>UK: LME copper briefly touches fresh high in pre-market.</title>
<headline>LME copper briefly touches fresh high in pre-market.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Climbs to new 11-1/2 month high of $2,488, then eases.</p>
<p>Still steadier above $2,470. Cash/threes back at $95/$100.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Straddling $1,660, touch firmer.</p>
<p>ZINC - Touch easier, just above $1,340.</p>
<p>NICKEL/LEAD - Firmer.</p>
<p>TIN/ALLOY - Dull.</p>
</text>
